  "details": "1.) Click the Inventory button in the menu.\n\n2.) It defaults to Photo Gallery instead of Bundles & Packs like it used to.\n\nThis new default behavior wastes time and bandwidth by forcing users to download and load a bunch of images that are shown in the Photo Gallery.\n\nEven when you select another option, it reverts to Photo Gallery every single time, so it's always causing unnecessary delays by having to load a bunch of images.",
